{"version":1,"key":"card:147","content":{"id":147,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"使用 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Insersection Observer","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 实现无限滚动。在列表的最后一项，放置一个元素，这个元素透明不可见，我们监听这个元素是否出现视口，如果出现在视口中，就说明滚动到底部，我们便请求新的数据，我们可以设置 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"rootMargin","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，提前加载，使用户无感知。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"<div id=\"goods\">\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n  <div class=\"good\"></div>\n</div>\n// 用以控制是否加载新的数据\n<div id=\"footer\"></div>","language":"html","uuid":"212cb278-a7f2-405e-8e07-d576364745a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"#goods {\n  width: 320px;\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;\n  gap: 20px;\n  margin: 20px auto;\n}\n\n.good {\n  height: 150px;\n  background: deeppink;\n}\n\n#footer {\n  background: transparent;\n  height: 10px;\n}","language":"css","uuid":"65fdb7d2-03ac-4948-9867-398079c9c238","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {\n  entries.forEach(entry => {\n    if (entry.isIntersecting) {\n      loadMore(10);\n    }\n  });\n}, {\n  // 扩展视口的底部区域，提前加载\n  rootMargin: '0px 0px 100px 0px'\n});\n\nconst loadMore = (n) => {\n  let appendedGoods = '';\n  for (let i = 0; i < n; i++) {\n    appendedGoods += '<div class=\"good\"></div>'\n  }\n  const goods = document.getElementById('goods');\n  goods.innerHTML = goods.innerHTML + appendedGoods;\n}\n\nconst footer = document.getElementById('footer');\nobserver.observe(footer);","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"5ada1c47-5708-4e3f-bf11-f4852209d8e4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"html-block","html":"<video style=\"max-width: 100%;\" controls src=\"https://video-obsidian.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/IntersectionObserver-%E6%97%A0%E9%99%90%E5%8A%A0%E8%BD%BD.mp4\"></video>","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["DOM/Intersection Observer/技巧","技巧/Intersection Observer"],"createTime":1690124868776,"updateTime":1752924208663,"linkedCards":[{"id":145,"target":{"key":"card:145","type":"card","id":145},"summary":"使用 IntersectionObserver 可以监听元素是否出现在视口中，其使用方法如下 // 创建 observer，接收两个参数 // 1. fn，被监听的元素出现在视口中时触发的回调函数 // 2. 创建 observer 的选项...","tags":["DOM/Intersection Observer"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1752924208663},"pluginRenderers":[{"runtimeVersion":1,"manifest":{"formatVersion":1,"id":"tau.html","name":"HTML","version":"0.1.4","minAppVersion":"0.59.0","apiVersion":1,"platform":"desktop","format":"cjs","main":"main.js","editor":true,"categories":["editor","ai"],"keywords":["HTML","网页","嵌入"],"integrity":{"main.js":"eafe74429244b57e1dce6a889e1e925f0cf178f5942afe95485f081a8fa048bf","main.css":"468f2feb73a33e5711b1583b609e4ab3818e83d5f19a38dcd9d027b77eb269d8"},"styles":"main.css"},"entry":"../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.4/7b4be5bc83e3b665c52aeaddc0c146d56eb1864201e835bf5ebaba71b8eb1536/main.js","styles":"../../plugin-assets/tau.html/0.1.4/7b4be5bc83e3b665c52aeaddc0c146d56eb1864201e835bf5ebaba71b8eb1536/style.css","nodeTypes":["html-block","html-inline"]}],"contentStyles":[{"href":"../styles/55302789dd1e4d975d3bd635c7fdc6b6808b860b7e13096887d41a75d45bc654.css","integrity":"55302789dd1e4d975d3bd635c7fdc6b6808b860b7e13096887d41a75d45bc654"}]}